### M8: email preferences
@baseUrl = {{$dotenv baseUrl}}
@accessToken = {{$dotenv accessToken}}

### Read the caller's invitation email preferences
GET {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/email-preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### Disable invitation email; the public contact email is unrelated
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/v1/me/email-preferences
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"teamInvitesEnabled":false,"preferredLanguage":"am"}

### Signed unsubscribe (public POST); use a locally generated test token only
POST {{baseUrl}}/v1/email/unsubscribe
Content-Type: application/json

{"token":"replace-with-a-signed-test-token"}
